### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8090
@riderUsername = rider1
@driverUsername = driver1

### 1. Health Check (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

###

### 2. Register Rider (Public)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup/rider
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{riderUsername}}",
  "password": "Secure123!",
  "fullName": "Sara Ahmadi",
  "phone": "09121234567",
  "homeAddress": "Tehran, Valiasr St."
}

###

### 3. Register Driver (Public)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup/driver
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{driverUsername}}",
  "password": "Secure123!",
  "fullName": "Reza Karimi",
  "phone": "09127654321",
  "vehicleLicenseNumber": "ABC-1234"
}

###

### 4. Duplicate Rider Registration (Expected: 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup/rider
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{riderUsername}}",
  "password": "Secure123!",
  "fullName": "Another Rider",
  "phone": "09121111111",
  "homeAddress": "Tehran"
}

###

### 5. Invalid Rider Registration (Expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup/rider
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "abc",
  "password": "123",
  "fullName": "",
  "phone": "123",
  "homeAddress": ""
}

###

### 6. Invalid Driver Registration (Expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup/driver
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "driver2",
  "password": "Secure123!",
  "fullName": "Test Driver",
  "phone": "09121234567",
  "vehicleLicenseNumber": ""
}

###

### 7. Login as Rider
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username={{riderUsername}}&password=Secure123!

###

### 8. Get Current Authenticated User
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

###

### 9. Get All Users (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

###

### 10. Login as Driver
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username={{driverUsername}}&password=Secure123!

###

### 11. Get Current Authenticated Driver
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

###

### 12. Get All Users Again
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
